<h1>A journal that helps your next cup taste better.</h1>
<p>Log each coffee or tea you brew — the recipe, and how it tasted. Brew Journal reads it like a barista would and tells you the <em>one</em> thing to change next time: grind finer, cooler water, a shorter steep.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Built for coffee methods from espresso to cold brew, and teas from green to pu-erh.</li>
  <li>No thermometer? Describe the bubbles in your kettle and it estimates the temperature.</li>
  <li>Tracks bean freshness and remembers your best recipe for every bag.</li>
</ul>
<p><a class="button" href="/register">Start a journal</a> &nbsp; <a href="/login">I have an account</a></p>
<p class="muted">Or try the <a href="/guide">brew calculator</a> without signing up.</p>
